WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.074 --> 00:00:01.258
- Have any of your friends

00:00:01.258 --> 00:00:03.593
ever told you that they
think I'm good looking?

00:00:03.593 --> 00:00:04.313
(giggling)

00:00:04.313 --> 00:00:05.910
- No.

00:00:08.957 --> 00:00:10.020
- True.

00:00:11.141 --> 00:00:13.388
(upbeat music)

00:00:15.435 --> 00:00:19.336
- I guess I just want her to be honest.

00:00:19.336 --> 00:00:21.072
And I just want us to laugh.

00:00:21.072 --> 00:00:23.580
Ultimately, just embarrass
the (beep) out of each other.

00:00:23.580 --> 00:00:27.550
- Jennifer is the biggest
liar in the family, easily.

00:00:27.550 --> 00:00:29.361
And when I say the family, I mean...

00:00:29.361 --> 00:00:30.871
I don't just mean the nuclear family,

00:00:30.871 --> 00:00:32.496
I mean the entire extended family.

00:00:32.496 --> 00:00:36.350
- I think she tells all kinds
of unnecessary white lies.

00:00:36.350 --> 00:00:38.463
- I would strongly warrant caution here,

00:00:38.463 --> 00:00:41.644
because whatever you say to
me to try and embarrass me,

00:00:41.644 --> 00:00:44.007
I will make it ten times worse for you.

00:00:48.022 --> 00:00:50.432
(suspenseful music)

00:00:58.357 --> 00:01:00.168
- Do you think you're funnier than me?

00:01:00.168 --> 00:01:00.832
- No.

00:01:00.832 --> 00:01:01.853
- Oh my god.

00:01:01.853 --> 00:01:03.636
- 100% no.

00:01:05.336 --> 00:01:06.451
- True.

00:01:06.451 --> 00:01:07.739
- Oh my god, honey bun.

00:01:07.739 --> 00:01:08.319
- You're welcome.

00:01:08.319 --> 00:01:09.411
- That's so nice of you.

00:01:09.411 --> 00:01:12.210
- Have you ever spit in my food?

00:01:15.630 --> 00:01:16.204
- Yes.

00:01:18.433 --> 00:01:19.403
- True.

00:01:19.408 --> 00:01:20.635
(giggling)

00:01:20.635 --> 00:01:21.889
- When did you spit in my food?

00:01:21.889 --> 00:01:23.532
- I'm sure I've done it multiple times.

00:01:23.532 --> 00:01:25.597
- Have you ever had a threesome?

00:01:25.597 --> 00:01:27.264
- No.

00:01:29.977 --> 00:01:31.486
- True.

00:01:31.486 --> 00:01:33.599
- I was kinda hoping you had.

00:01:33.599 --> 00:01:35.288
- Does your boyfriend think I'm cool?

00:01:35.781 --> 00:01:37.262
- Yes.

00:01:39.125 --> 00:01:40.077
- That's a lie.

00:01:40.077 --> 00:01:41.702
(giggling)

00:01:41.702 --> 00:01:44.372
- He's never said you're uncool.

00:01:44.372 --> 00:01:46.040
- Steve, I'm coming for you.

00:01:46.040 --> 00:01:47.665
- Who do you think is better looking?

00:01:47.665 --> 00:01:49.151
You or me?

00:01:49.151 --> 00:01:51.027
- You.

00:01:53.679 --> 00:01:54.956
- True.

00:01:54.956 --> 00:01:56.721
- Why are you so disappointed?

00:01:56.721 --> 00:01:58.945
Like, you came here to fight.

00:01:58.945 --> 00:02:00.152
- I wanted to fight.

00:02:00.152 --> 00:02:02.376
- I'm a nice person.

00:02:05.492 --> 00:02:07.739
(suspenseful music)

00:02:12.249 --> 00:02:15.221
Do you think I'm a good person?

00:02:15.221 --> 00:02:16.725
- Yes.

00:02:18.704 --> 00:02:19.396
- True.

00:02:19.396 --> 00:02:21.124
- Woohoo! Finally.

00:02:21.124 --> 00:02:22.029
- Oh my god.

00:02:22.029 --> 00:02:24.165
- I might've saved you
from a lot of (beep).

00:02:24.165 --> 00:02:26.743
- Do you get jealous when I'm successful?

00:02:26.743 --> 00:02:28.130
- No.

00:02:29.088 --> 00:02:30.318
- True.

00:02:30.318 --> 00:02:31.788
- Cool.

00:02:31.788 --> 00:02:36.204
- Have you ever been attracted
to any of my ex-boyfriends?

00:02:36.204 --> 00:02:37.731
- No.

00:02:39.965 --> 00:02:41.266
- That's a lie.

00:02:41.266 --> 00:02:43.397
- Oh god.

00:02:43.397 --> 00:02:45.440
- Have you ever been in love?

00:02:45.440 --> 00:02:47.548
- No.

00:02:50.664 --> 00:02:52.568
- That's a lie.

00:02:52.568 --> 00:02:54.147
(giggling)

00:02:54.147 --> 00:02:55.099
- Who is it?

00:02:55.099 --> 00:02:57.862
- I mean, I love my dogs,
and I love my parents.

00:02:57.862 --> 00:03:01.293
- Do you enjoy living with me?

00:03:05.060 --> 00:03:06.268
- Yes.

00:03:10.418 --> 00:03:11.313
- That's a lie.

00:03:11.313 --> 00:03:13.010
(giggling)

00:03:14.618 --> 00:03:16.782
- If you're not an
honest person, like then,

00:03:16.782 --> 00:03:20.008
there is no trust, and
there's no foundation there.

00:03:20.008 --> 00:03:21.676
So that sucks.

00:03:21.676 --> 00:03:25.122
- For the most part, I think
everyone should be honest,

00:03:25.122 --> 00:03:27.365
or else it's gonna come
bite you in the ass.

00:03:27.365 --> 00:03:31.661
- So the fact that the things
that she lied about were,

00:03:31.661 --> 00:03:34.168
I feel like they were minimal.

00:03:34.168 --> 00:03:36.397
They were more like, hilarious.

00:03:36.397 --> 00:03:39.801
But I love that we still have
a strong, honest foundation.

